efore Main::setup2().\r\n\r\nWIth this change we are able to register GDExtensions in LibGodot just after the GodotInstance was returned from libgodot_create_instance(), but before GodotInstance::start() was called on it.\r\n\r\nWe are using this feature to inject GDExtensions into Godot before they are initialized. For example we have been using this feature to inject a modified Sentry GDExtension in a react-native-godot project.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by [Migeran](https://migeran.com)\r\nSponsored by [Xibbon Inc.](https://xibbon.com).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\nThis is the next part of the LibGodot feature.\r\nOriginal feature: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90510\r\nMerged PRs:\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110863\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123717","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124011/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124011/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}